#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/3
msgid ""
"Still just a kid.\n"
msgstr ""
"还只是个孩子。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/4
msgid ""
"Which is exactly why she could be an\n"
"effective source of information.\n"
msgstr ""
"这正是为什么她能成为\n"
"有效的信息来源。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/5
msgid ""
"Besides, that little ángel de la paz is the\n"
"one who gave us this mission, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"再说，那个小天使\n"
"就是给我们这个任务的人，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/6
msgid ""
"...I guess.\n"
msgstr ""
"……大概吧。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/7
msgid ""
"I'll put her on.\n"
msgstr ""
"我让她接。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/9
msgid ""
"Paz. Where are you?\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹。你在哪？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/10
msgid ""
"Ciudad Colón. A school. The teacher told\n"
"me to stay here until things quiet down.\n"
msgstr ""
"科隆城。一所学校。老师让我\n"
"待在这里直到局势平静下来。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/11
msgid ""
"Teacher? Oh, him. He's... Yeah, that's\n"
"probably good advice.\n"
msgstr ""
"老师？哦，他啊。他……是的，那\n"
"大概是个好建议。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/12
msgid ""
"Si. He has a radio in his room, so we can\n"
"talk anytime.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。他房间里有一台收音机，所以我们\n"
"随时都能联系。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/13
msgid ""
"...Pretty fancy for a teacher.\n"
msgstr ""
"……老师挺阔气。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/14
msgid ""
"Promise me, Snake, that you'll bring back\n"
"peace. And...\n"
msgstr ""
"答应我，Snake，你会带回\n"
"和平。还有……\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/15
msgid ""
"I know. I'll contact you if I find your friend.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道。找到你朋友就联系你。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/16
msgid ""
"Thank you. Snake, if you need to know\n"
"about Costa Rica\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢。Snake，若你想了解\n"
"哥斯达黎加\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/17
msgid ""
"- the geography, the climate, the wildlife,\n"
"anything - just ask me.\n"
msgstr ""
"地理、气候、野生动物，\n"
"啥都行，尽管问我。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/18
msgid ""
"I know about its history and laws, too. We\n"
"learned it all in school.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也了解它的历史和律法。我们\n"
"在学校都学过。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/19
msgid ""
"Got it. I have a question, I'll ask.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。有问题我就问。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/20
msgid ""
"...I, uh...\n"
msgstr ""
"……我，呃……\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/22
msgid ""
"In school I also learned that peace is an\n"
"unnatural state for human society.\n"
msgstr ""
"学校还教我，和平对人类社会\n"
"是非自然状态。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/23
msgid ""
"And that war is a constant threat to our\n"
"relationships with others.\n"
msgstr ""
"而战争是对我们与他人关系的\n"
"持续威胁。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/25
msgid ""
"So, to achieve peace, we have to create\n"
"it ourselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以，和平得靠我们亲手\n"
"创造。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/26
msgid ""
"Crying about it won't bring it about, or\n"
"make it last.\n"
msgstr ""
"哭泣不会带来和平，也\n"
"不会让它持久。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/27
msgid ""
"Each one of us must go and seek it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"每个人都得自己去追寻。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/28
msgid ""
"You won't find it without making sacrifices.\n"
msgstr ""
"不付出牺牲就找不到。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/29
msgid ""
"No offense, but I don't know what peace\n"
"is.\n"
msgstr ""
"无意冒犯，但我不知道和平\n"
"是什么。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/30
msgid ""
"Never felt what it's like. Never even been\n"
"interested in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"从未感受过。甚至从未\n"
"对它感兴趣。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/31
msgid ""
"Snake...?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE……？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/32
msgid ""
"Ah, sorry.\n"
msgstr ""
"啊，抱歉。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/33
msgid ""
"Listen Paz, I think your ideas are...\n"
"admirable, and I hope they turn out to be\n"
"right.\n"
msgstr ""
"听着，帕兹，你的想法……\n"
"令人敬佩，我也希望\n"
"你是对的。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/34
msgid ""
"Yeah, me too.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯，我也是。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/35
msgid ""
"Peace is in your name. Who better to\n"
"help bring it back?\n"
msgstr ""
"和平在你名字里。谁更\n"
"适合找回它？\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/36
msgid ""
"Thanks, Snake. I will be here whenever\n"
"you need me. See you later.\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢，SNAKE。你需要我时\n"
"我随时都在。回头见。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/37
msgid ""
"Snake, use your radio to call people.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，用无线电联系人。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/38
msgid ""
"But stay alert.\n"
msgstr ""
"但保持警惕。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/39
msgid ""
"You're in the middle of a mission, and\n"
"can't afford to let your guard down.\n"
msgstr ""
"你正在执行任务，\n"
"不能放松戒备。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/41
msgid ""
"Need to know more about Costa Rica?\n"
"Paz can help you out.\n"
msgstr ""
"想多了解哥斯达黎加？\n"
"帕兹能帮你。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/42
msgid ""
"Good to know.\n"
msgstr ""
"知道了。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/43
msgid ""
"We'll follow their transport route. That\n"
"should take us straight to their main base.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们跟着他们的运输路线走。\n"
"应该能直达他们的主基地。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/44
msgid ""
"From what I've seen, it looks like nukes.\n"
msgstr ""
"看情况，像是核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/45
msgid ""
"Agreed.\n"
msgstr ""
"同意\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/46
msgid ""
"The key thing now is to confirm whether\n"
"those \"spears\" really are what we think\n"
"they are, and if so, why they're here.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在关键是确认那些“矛”\n"
"是否真如我们所想，\n"
"若是，又为何在此。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/47
msgid ""
"Follow the transport route, find the nukes.\n"
msgstr ""
"跟着运输路线，找到核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/48
msgid ""
"That's what I'm thinking.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也这么想。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/49
msgid ""
"First, we should make contact with the\n"
"Sandinista comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"首先，我们得联系上\n"
"桑地诺派的指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/50
msgid ""
"They can tell us more about what's up\n"
"ahead.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们能告诉我们\n"
"前方的情况。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/51
msgid ""
"But it looks like their hideout's already\n"
"come under attack.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他们的藏身处\n"
"似乎已遭攻击。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/52
msgid ""
"We'd better hope they're still alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"但愿他们还活着。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/53
msgid ""
"Snake, infiltrate that cabin and secure\n"
"the Sandinistas' comandante.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，潜入那间小屋，\n"
"保护桑地诺派指挥官。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/54
msgid ""
"Neutralize any guards by knocking them\n"
"out,\n"
msgstr ""
"击倒守卫，将其制服\n"
"击晕，\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/55
msgid ""
"putting them to sleep, or even using the\n"
"Fulton recovery system.\n"
msgstr ""
"让他们昏睡，或用\n"
"富尔顿回收系统。\n"

#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/56
msgid ""
"You choose how to handle it, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么处理由你定，BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387380/0
msgid ""
"Snake, what was that thing?!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，那啥玩意？！\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 821..1532
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/1
msgid ""
"Whatever it was, it looked unmanned.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管是什么，看起来是无人操控的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 1602..2716
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/2
msgid ""
"Unmanned? I'd heard rumors, but an\n"
"operational unit...?\n"
msgstr ""
"无人？我听过传言，但已经有\n"
"实战机型了……？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 2716..3274
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/3
msgid ""
"What the hell is going on here?\n"
msgstr ""
"这里到底发生了什么？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 3315..4820
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/4
msgid ""
"Not to quote Amanda, but the hardware\n"
"they've got here isn't just unusual, it's\n"
"overkill.\n"
msgstr ""
"不是学阿曼达，但他们这的\n"
"装备不只罕见，简直\n"
"火力过剩。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 4876..6227
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/5
msgid ""
"Which means one thing: it's nukes. So the\n"
"question now becomes, why?\n"
msgstr ""
"那就意味一件事：是核武。那\n"
"现在问题是，为啥？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 6227..7174
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/6
msgid ""
"We can't make that call yet. We need\n"
"more intel.\n"
msgstr ""
"还不能下结论。需要\n"
"更多情报。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 7244..7885
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/7
msgid ""
"How? Our source is dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么弄？线人已经死了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 8052..8554
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/8
msgid ""
"But his daughter isn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他女儿没死。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 8609..9264
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/9
msgid ""
"Good thinking. We can follow her...\n"
msgstr ""
"好主意。可以跟着她……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 9362..10602
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/10
msgid ""
"Head for that the next outpost, and make\n"
"contact with Amanda... if she's still alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"前往下一个哨站，联系\n"
"阿曼达……如果她还活着。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 10616..10866
#: codec/2/903/0x387380/11
msgid ""
"Roger.\n"
msgstr ""
"收到。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/0
msgid ""
"The direction Amanda's Sandinistas were\n"
"going\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达的桑地诺军前进的\n"
"方向\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/1
msgid ""
"corresponds to the location of the next\n"
"outpost, a supply depot.\n"
msgstr ""
"正好对应下一个哨站的位置，\n"
"一个补给站。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x387770/2
msgid ""
"We should be able to make contact with\n"
"her there.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们应该能在那里联系上\n"
"她。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3878d0/0
msgid ""
"That's an armored vehicle unit, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是装甲车部队，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3878d0/1
msgid ""
"Either destroy the vehicle or neutralize\n"
"the soldiers. Take it out!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么摧毁车辆，要么制伏\n"
"士兵。干掉它！\n"

#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Amanda's reached the plant.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，阿曼达到了工厂。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 1462..2117
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/2
msgid ""
"Amanda, how do you feel?\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，你感觉怎么样？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 2229..3705
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/3
msgid ""
"Some first helicopter ride. I'll be perfectly\n"
"happy if it's my last.\n"
msgstr ""
"头一回坐直升机。要是最后一次\n"
"我可太高兴了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 3817..4444
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/4
msgid ""
"As you can see, she's doing fine.\n"
msgstr ""
"如你所见，她没事。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 4486..5879
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/5
msgid ""
"I set Amanda up with her own frequency,\n"
"so call her anytime you need to.\n"
msgstr ""
"我给阿曼达设了专属频率，\n"
"有需要随时呼她。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 5935..8317
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/6
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about American\n"
"bases or mercenary units, or about el\n"
"Frente, just ask.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是对美国的基地或雇佣兵部队，\n"
"或者对Frente有疑问，\n"
"尽管问。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 8373..9877
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/7
msgid ""
"And please, don't forget my compas and\n"
"Chico...\n"
msgstr ""
"还有，别忘了我的compas和\n"
"奇科……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 9919..10309
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/8
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice 
#. timeline 10337..11131
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/9
msgid ""
"It’s good to be working with you, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"很高兴与你共事，BOSS。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 11243..12190
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/10
msgid ""
"Snake, we can monitor her condition in\n"
"sick bay.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，可在医务室\n"
"监控她状况。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 12288..13472
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/11
msgid ""
"Remember to assign roles to any POWs\n"
"you bring back to Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"记得给带回母基地的战俘\n"
"分配岗位。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 13569..14712
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/12
msgid ""
"How this outfit gets built depends on who\n"
"we assign to what jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"部队怎么建，看我们\n"
"把谁分到什么岗。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 14740..15436
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/13
msgid ""
"That'll determine how Mother Base grows.\n"
msgstr ""
"这决定了母基地的发展。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice 
#. timeline 15478..16161
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/14
msgid ""
"It's one of your most important roles,\n"
"Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是你最重要的职责之一，\n"
"BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Chico made it over.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，奇科来了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/2
msgid ""
"Chico, you made it.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科，你成功了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/3
msgid ""
"Made it?! Don't give me that!\n"
msgstr ""
"成功？！少来这套！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/4
msgid ""
"You say you're gonna give me a new life,\n"
"and then you nearly kill me?!\n"
msgstr ""
"你说要给我新生活，\n"
"结果差点要了我的命？！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/5
msgid ""
"I take it you didn't enjoy the trip?\n"
msgstr ""
"看来你这趟不太愉快？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/6
msgid ""
"What's the big idea, dragging me off in a...\n"
"balloon!\n"
msgstr ""
"你搞什么，用个……\n"
"气球把我拖走！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/7
msgid ""
"I might as well have taken a colibri!\n"
msgstr ""
"我还不如坐蜂鸟号！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/8
msgid ""
"At least you got a nice view. Or are you\n"
"afraid of heights?\n"
msgstr ""
"至少风景不错。还是说\n"
"你恐高？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/9
msgid ""
"Whatever. I just wish you'd explained it to\n"
"me first.\n"
msgstr ""
"随便吧。我只希望你先\n"
"跟我解释清楚。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/10
msgid ""
"Would you have agreed to go if I did?\n"
msgstr ""
"我解释了你就会答应吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/11
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving us, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你救我们，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/12
msgid ""
"Amanda, a word of advice.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，给你个忠告。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/14
msgid ""
"Stop treating him like a child.\n"
msgstr ""
"别再把他当小孩了。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/15
msgid ""
"Yes... yes, I know. You're right. I shouldn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"是……是，我知道。你说得对，我不该这样。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/16
msgid ""
"Amanda, you're coming back after your\n"
"leg heals, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，腿好了之后\n"
"你会回来吧？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/17
msgid ""
"Of course. We still have work to do.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然。我们还有事要做。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/18
msgid ""
"\"We,\" huh... Are you sure you've got\n"
"Chico's future in mind when you say that?\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们”……你说这话时，\n"
"有考虑过奇科的未来吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/19
msgid ""
"What do you mean? We're sworn to our\n"
"father's cause, to helping the revolution\n"
"succeed.\n"
msgstr ""
"什么意思？我们宣誓继承\n"
"父亲的遗志，帮助革命\n"
"成功。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/20
msgid ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a\n"
"gun, and sooner or later you're going to\n"
"hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a\n"
"gun, and sooner or later you're going to\n"
"hell.\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/21
msgid ""
"Are you prepared for that?\n"
msgstr ""
"你准备好了吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/22
msgid ""
"I am. If the alternative is giving up the\n"
"country I love, I'll take hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"准备好了。若要我放弃深爱的祖国，\n"
"我宁愿下地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/23
msgid ""
"Really... Well then, you're going to have to\n"
"stop treating Chico like a brother\n"
msgstr ""
"是吗……那你不能再把奇科\n"
"当弟弟看待，\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/24
msgid ""
"and start treating him like a soldier.\n"
msgstr ""
"而要把他当士兵。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/25
msgid ""
"I ...You're right.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……你说得对。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/26
msgid ""
"...Welcome to hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"……欢迎来到地狱。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/27
msgid ""
"Snake, can I ask you a favor?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，能拜托你吗？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/28
msgid ""
"Shoot.\n"
msgstr ""
"说吧。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/29
msgid ""
"You find any prisoners from el Frente,\n"
"you bring 'em back alive. 'Cause...\n"
msgstr ""
"找到Frente的俘虏，\n"
"要活捉带回来。因为……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/30
msgid ""
"You trying to make amends for talking?\n"
msgstr ""
"你是想为泄密赎罪？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/31
msgid ""
"Not just that. Because they're compas...\n"
msgstr ""
"不止如此。因为他们是同胞……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/32
msgid ""
"All right. But first I've gotta catch up to\n"
"that cargo.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。但我得先追上\n"
"那批货物。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/33
msgid ""
"I'll do whatever I can to help.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会尽力帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/34
msgid ""
"Call me if there's anything you need to\n"
"know about the area. And...\n"
msgstr ""
"想了解这一带的情况\n"
"就呼我。还有……\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/35
msgid ""
"And what?\n"
msgstr ""
"还有什么？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/36
msgid ""
"Let me know if you encounter any wildlife\n"
"you've never seen before.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是遇到没见过的野生动物，\n"
"告诉我。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/37
msgid ""
"Never seen before? What, like that\n"
"basilisco you were talking about?\n"
msgstr ""
"没见过的？像你说的\n"
"那种蛇怪？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/38
msgid ""
"I'm talking about UMAs.\n"
msgstr ""
"我说的是UMA。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/39
msgid ""
"U... M... As?\n"
msgstr ""
"未……知……生物？\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/40
msgid ""
"Y'know, like ancient dinosaurs or\n"
"legendary monsters.\n"
msgstr ""
"就是古代恐龙或\n"
"传说怪物那种。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/41
msgid ""
"One day, I'm going to be a hunter.\n"
msgstr ""
"总有一天，我要当猎人。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/42
msgid ""
"Is that right. OK, sure.\n"
msgstr ""
"是吗。好，行。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/43
msgid ""
"If you wanna know more, I'm happy to tell\n"
"you!\n"
msgstr ""
"想了解更多，\n"
"我很乐意告诉你！\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/44
msgid ""
"Right. I'll be in touch, Chico.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。保持联系，奇科。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/45
msgid ""
"OK, Snake. The enemy's cargo is headed\n"
"for the next outpost, a rail terminal.\n"
msgstr ""
"OK，SNAKE。敌人货物正运往\n"
"下一哨站，一个铁路终点站。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/46
msgid ""
"Chico says no one's ever set foot past\n"
"there.\n"
msgstr ""
"Chico说从没人踏足过\n"
"那里。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/47
msgid ""
"Their main base is probably on the other\n"
"side of that tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们的主基地很可能在隧道\n"
"另一侧。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/48
msgid ""
"Unless we catch those spears before\n"
"reaching it, they'll be in enemy hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"除非在抵达前截住那些长矛，\n"
"否则就会落入敌手。\n"

#: codec/2/904/0x388570/49
msgid ""
"You've got to stop them. Hurry, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"必须阻止他们。快，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, according to Chico, the nuclear\n"
"materials will be loaded from a train and\n"
"on to a truck\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，据Chico说，核材料会从一列火车上\n"
"卸下，再\n"
"装上卡车\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/1
msgid ""
"at a rail terminal near the eastern foot of\n"
"Irazú.\n"
msgstr ""
"在Irazú东麓附近的\n"
"一个铁路终端。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/2
msgid ""
"If we can't cut 'em off at that terminal,\n"
"we'll be in a world of hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是在那个终端截不住，\n"
"我们就惨了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x3894b0/3
msgid ""
"Hurry, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"快，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389670/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's an enemy tank unit.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！敌方坦克部队。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389670/1
msgid ""
"Either neutralize the soldiers or destroy\n"
"the tank. Get 'em!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么解决士兵，要么摧毁\n"
"坦克。干掉他们！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the truck is headed up the\n"
"mountain road past the tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，卡车正沿穿过隧道的\n"
"山路上行。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/1
msgid ""
"So it was nukes after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"果然是核弹。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/2
msgid ""
"What now? Their main base is up ahead.\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么办？主基地在前面。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/3
msgid ""
"I better hurry after 'em, then.\n"
msgstr ""
"那我得赶紧追上去。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/5
msgid ""
"Kaz, if I don't get moving it'll be too late!\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，再不动身就来不及了！\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/6
msgid ""
"All right.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/7
msgid ""
"I guess you never let dangerous\n"
"assignments or risk aversion get in your\n"
"way.\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜你从不让危险的\n"
"任务或对风险的顾虑挡你的\n"
"路。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/8
msgid ""
"How do I get inside the mountain? I can\n"
"forget about the tunnel.\n"
msgstr ""
"我该怎么进山？隧道\n"
"不用管了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/9
msgid ""
"Yeah, the tank took care of that...\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，坦克解决了……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/10
msgid ""
"Any other routes?\n"
msgstr ""
"还有别的路吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/11
msgid ""
"Why don't I let a local expert take over?\n"
msgstr ""
"不如让本地专家来说？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/12
msgid ""
"Snake, you need a way into the mountain?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你要找进山的路？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/13
msgid ""
"Yeah. Got one?\n"
msgstr ""
"对。有吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/14
msgid ""
"Let's see... You remember that prison I\n"
"was in?\n"
msgstr ""
"我想想……记得我\n"
"待过的监狱吗？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/15
msgid ""
"In the village, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"在村里，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/16
msgid ""
"Right. Go back to the village and head\n"
"north.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。回村子，然后往\n"
"北走。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/17
msgid ""
"There's a bridge that connects to the\n"
"mountain road.\n"
msgstr ""
"有一座桥连接着\n"
"山路。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/18
msgid ""
"It crosses over a gorge. That's probably\n"
"the best way...\n"
msgstr ""
"它横跨峡谷。那大概\n"
"是最好的路线……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/19
msgid ""
"But there is a little problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"但有个小问题。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/20
msgid ""
"The path heading north from the village\n"
"is barricaded.\n"
msgstr ""
"从村子往北的那条路\n"
"被路障封住了。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/21
msgid ""
"You might have to break through...\n"
msgstr ""
"你可能得强行突破……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/23
msgid ""
"The heart of Irazú...\n"
msgstr ""
"伊拉苏心脏……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/24
msgid ""
"That's where the enemy's base has got\n"
"to be, Snake. And maybe...\n"
msgstr ""
"That's where the enemy's base has got\n"
"to be, Snake. And maybe...\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/25
msgid ""
"Let me guess - the basilisco?\n"
msgstr ""
"让我猜猜——蛇怪？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/26
msgid ""
"You don't believe me, do you?\n"
msgstr ""
"你不信我，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/27
msgid ""
"No, I mean... We'll have to see.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，我是说……得亲眼看看。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/28
msgid ""
"Snake, Irazú features a number of crater\n"
"lakes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，伊拉苏有好几个火山口\n"
"湖。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/29
msgid ""
"The Oduber government had planned to\n"
"use those lakes\n"
msgstr ""
"奥杜贝尔政府曾计划\n"
"利用那些湖\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/30
msgid ""
"to construct hydroelectric plants as one\n"
"of its big state development projects.\n"
msgstr ""
"修建水电站，作为其\n"
"大型国家开发项目之一。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/31
msgid ""
"The project was scrapped,\n"
msgstr ""
"项目被取消了，\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/32
msgid ""
"but there's still a small opening at the\n"
"bottom of the lake.\n"
msgstr ""
"但湖底仍然有一个\n"
"小开口。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/34
msgid ""
"I checked the satellite imagery, but didn't\n"
"see anything man-made.\n"
msgstr ""
"我查看了卫星图像，但没\n"
"看到任何人造物。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/35
msgid ""
"Which means they've probably built a\n"
"base inside the mountain...\n"
msgstr ""
"这意味着他们很可能在山体\n"
"内建了基地……\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/36
msgid ""
"Could just be a storage igloo for\n"
"explosives, or maybe some kind of\n"
"research facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"可能只是个存放\n"
"炸药的圆顶仓库，或者某种\n"
"研究设施。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/37
msgid ""
"What do they hope to accomplish by\n"
"bringing the nukes there?\n"
msgstr ""
"他们把核弹运到那，\n"
"到底想干什么？\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/38
msgid ""
"First things first. Get past that barricade\n"
"north of the village.\n"
msgstr ""
"先做最要紧的事。越过村子\n"
"北边那个路障。\n"

#: codec/2/905/0x389770/39
msgid ""
"Looks like the only way through is the\n"
"noisy way - you'll have to blow it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来唯一的办法就是\n"
"闹出动静——你得把它炸掉。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you're north of the village.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你在村子北边。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/1
msgid ""
"The truck carrying the nukes is heading\n"
"towards the heart of the mountain.\n"
msgstr ""
"载着核弹的卡车正朝\n"
"山体中心驶去。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a380/2
msgid ""
"That's its final destination. We've got no\n"
"intel on what lies beyond, so stay sharp.\n"
msgstr ""
"那就是终点。我们对\n"
"前方一无所知，保持警惕。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/0
msgid ""
"Careful, Snake!!\n"
msgstr ""
"小心，SNAKE！！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/1
msgid ""
"I've never seen anything like that, and I've\n"
"got no idea how to bring it down.\n"
msgstr ""
"我从没见过这种东西，\n"
"也不知道怎么把它打下来。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a500/2
msgid ""
"Maybe the scientist knows. However you\n"
"do it, take that thing out!\n"
msgstr ""
"也许那科学家知道。不管怎样，\n"
"把那东西干掉！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the doctor's safe here with us.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，博士在这很安全。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/1
msgid ""
"Huey, how're you feeling?\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊，感觉如何？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/2
msgid ""
"Never better. This is quite the pad you've\n"
"got here, Boss. I'm impressed.\n"
msgstr ""
"再好不过了。你这基地真不错，BOSS。\n"
"我很佩服。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/3
msgid ""
"Call me Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"叫我SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/4
msgid ""
"Whatever you say. Like it or not,\n"
"everyone here calls you Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"随你便。不管喜不喜欢，\n"
"这儿的人都叫你BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/5
msgid ""
"By the way, if you're at all interested in\n"
"improving your tech,\n"
msgstr ""
"对了，如果你有兴趣\n"
"提升技术的话，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/6
msgid ""
"by all means assign me to the R&D section.\n"
msgstr ""
"尽管把我派到研发部门。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/7
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I'll be of some use.\n"
msgstr ""
"我肯定能派上用场。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/8
msgid ""
"Once we have the necessary materials\n"
"and blueprints, we can start work on that\n"
"bipedal mech.\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦有了必要的材料和图纸，\n"
"我们就能开始造那台\n"
"双足机甲了。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/9
msgid ""
"I appreciate that, but are you sure you're\n"
"OK with having your work used for war?\n"
msgstr ""
"多谢，但你确定\n"
"愿意让自己的成果用于战争？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/10
msgid ""
"I'm... I'll be using it to keep past mistakes\n"
"in check.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……我会用它来\n"
"约束过去的错误。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/11
msgid ""
"If I can help thwart the Peace Walker\n"
"project, I'm happy to do it.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果能帮忙挫败和平行者\n"
"计划，我很乐意。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/12
msgid ""
"Deterrence theory, Huey-style, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊式威慑理论，是吧？\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/13
msgid ""
"Heh. Anyway, if you need any intel on the\n"
"enemy's weapons or electronic brains,\n"
"contact me.\n"
msgstr ""
"呵。总之，如果你需要敌方武器\n"
"或电子脑的情报，\n"
"就联系我。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/14
msgid ""
"I've been given my own frequency.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们给了我专属频率。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/15
msgid ""
"Sounds good to me, Doc. I'll do that.\n"
msgstr ""
"不错，博士。我会的。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38a660/16
msgid ""
"Good. Whatever the means, you must put\n"
"a stop to their plans!\n"
msgstr ""
"很好。不管怎样，\n"
"必须阻止他们！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker is the heart of the\n"
"enemy's project.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，和平行者是\n"
"敌方计划的核心。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/1
msgid ""
"To prevent its completion,\n"
msgstr ""
"要阻止它完成，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/2
msgid ""
"you'll need to either shut down or destroy\n"
"the artificial intelligence that functions as\n"
"its brain.\n"
msgstr ""
"你得关闭或摧毁\n"
"充当其大脑的\n"
"人工智能。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/3
msgid ""
"According to Huey,\n"
msgstr ""
"据休伊说，\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/4
msgid ""
"that AI is now undergoing final\n"
"calibrations in Strangelove's lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"那个AI正在斯特兰奇洛夫的\n"
"实验室里做最终校准。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/5
msgid ""
"It's inside a tropical cloud forest.\n"
msgstr ""
"在热带云雾林里。\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38ac60/6
msgid ""
"Slip in and terminate that AI before they\n"
"ship it out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Slip in and terminate that AI before they\n"
"ship it out.\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38af00/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's a Hind! You've got to take\n"
"it out somehow!\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake！那是雌鹿！快想办法\n"
"干掉它！\n"

#: codec/2/906/0x38af00/1
msgid ""
"Either neutralize the soldiers or bring\n"
"down the chopper! Good luck!\n"
msgstr ""
"要么解决士兵，要么打下直升机！\n"
"祝你好运！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b020/0
msgid ""
"Snake,\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b020/1
msgid ""
"infiltrate Dr. Strangelove's research lab\n"
"and either deactivate or destroy the AI.\n"
msgstr ""
"潜入Strangelove博士的研究实验室，\n"
"并停用或摧毁那个AI。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b020/2
msgid ""
"The lab's built into some ancient ruins, so\n"
"find those first!\n"
msgstr ""
"实验室在古代遗迹里，\n"
"先找到遗迹！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/0
msgid ""
"Snake?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/1
msgid ""
"Huey, your ID card isn't working.\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊，你的ID卡不管用。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/2
msgid ""
"It won't open the lock!\n"
msgstr ""
"打不开锁！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/3
msgid ""
"...It can't be...\n"
msgstr ""
"…不可能…\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/4
msgid ""
"What's going on?!\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么了？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/5
msgid ""
"She hates me that much?!\n"
msgstr ""
"她就那么恨我？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/6
msgid ""
"...Strangelove's in charge of authorizing\n"
"IDs.\n"
msgstr ""
"……Strangelove负责授权\n"
"ID。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/7
msgid ""
"Sometimes a working card has its\n"
"privileges removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"有时候一张能用的卡会被\n"
"取消权限。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/8
msgid ""
"...Say, if she decides she doesn't like that\n"
"card's carrier.\n"
msgstr ""
"……比如，如果她不喜欢那张\n"
"卡的持有者。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/9
msgid ""
"You think that's what happened?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得是这样？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/10
msgid ""
"Well, I was never exactly her favorite.\n"
msgstr ""
"反正我从不是她的红人。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/11
msgid ""
"Well, this could be tricky.\n"
msgstr ""
"这下麻烦了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/12
msgid ""
"The soldiers outside aren't allowed in the\n"
"lab either, so their cards won't do you\n"
"any good...\n"
msgstr ""
"外面的士兵也不被允许进入\n"
"实验室，所以他们的卡对你\n"
"没用……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/13
msgid ""
"Great...\n"
msgstr ""
"好极了……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/14
msgid ""
"Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/15
msgid ""
"Kaz, where's Cecile?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，塞西尔呢？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/16
msgid ""
"She just got here. Hold on.\n"
msgstr ""
"她刚到。等等。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/18
msgid ""
"Cecile. How'd it feel to fly?\n"
msgstr ""
"塞西尔。飞得爽吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/19
msgid ""
"Wonderful. For a moment, I felt what it\n"
"must be like to be a bird.\n"
msgstr ""
"太棒了。一瞬间，我仿佛成了鸟\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/20
msgid ""
"It almost made me want to give up my\n"
"research and get a pilot's license...\n"
msgstr ""
"这几乎让我想放弃我的\n"
"研究去考个飞行员执照……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/21
msgid ""
"Did you need something?\n"
msgstr ""
"你找我有事？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/22
msgid ""
"You said you'd gotten an ID card, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"你说你弄到过ID卡，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/23
msgid ""
"Yes. But it was confiscated when the\n"
"guards caught me.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。但警卫抓住我时\n"
"把它没收了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/24
msgid ""
"Who took it?! What'd he look like?!\n"
msgstr ""
"谁拿的？！他长啥样？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/25
msgid ""
"He had on an orange jacket.\n"
msgstr ""
"他穿着橙色夹克。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/26
msgid ""
"I... cannot recall his face, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我记不清他的脸。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/27
msgid ""
"Yeah, they all look pretty much the same.\n"
"Where did it happen?\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，它们看着都差不多。\n"
"这是在哪发生的？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/28
msgid ""
"Let me think...\n"
msgstr ""
"让我想想……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/29
msgid ""
"Ah, yes! I do remember hearing the song\n"
"of a nearby quetzal.\n"
msgstr ""
"啊对！我记得听到附近凤尾绿咬鹃的\n"
"歌声。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/30
msgid ""
"Just what I'd expect from a birder.\n"
msgstr ""
"不愧是观鸟人。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/31
msgid ""
"Would you like to hear it?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想听听吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/32
msgid ""
"Hmm? What's that song?\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯？什么叫声？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/33
msgid ""
"It's my quetzal. I took it with me when I\n"
"was rescued.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是我的凤尾绿咬鹃。我被救出来的时候\n"
"把它带上了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/34
msgid ""
"Didn't you say something about them\n"
"being covered under the Washington\n"
"Convention...\n"
msgstr ""
"你不是说过它们\n"
"受《华盛顿\n"
"公约》保护吗……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/35
msgid ""
"Just kidding. That was just me... an\n"
"imitation.\n"
msgstr ""
"开玩笑的。那只是我……\n"
"模仿的。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/36
msgid ""
"An essential skill for any ornithologist.\n"
"Pretty good, no?\n"
msgstr ""
"这是鸟类学家必备的技能。\n"
"很不错吧？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/37
msgid ""
"Damn good.\n"
msgstr ""
"真像。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/38
msgid ""
"If you want to hear the quetzal's song\n"
"again, just let me know.\n"
msgstr ""
"想再听一次凤尾绿咬鹃的歌声，\n"
"告诉我就行。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/39
msgid ""
"I can tell you all about the birds of Costa\n"
"Rica, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也能给你讲哥斯达黎加的\n"
"各种鸟类。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/40
msgid ""
"Yeah... will do. Thanks, Cecile.\n"
msgstr ""
"好……一定。谢了，塞西尔。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/41
msgid ""
"No, no, thank you, Snake. Talk to you\n"
"soon.\n"
msgstr ""
"不不，谢谢你，Snake。回头\n"
"聊。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/42
msgid ""
"Kaz, did you play that tape for Cecile?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，那盘磁带放给塞西尔听了吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/43
msgid ""
"I sure did. It's hers, all right.\n"
msgstr ""
"放了。确实是她的。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/44
msgid ""
"Then she must be...\n"
msgstr ""
"那她准是……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/45
msgid ""
"She's not. Cecile says she's never even\n"
"met Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"她不是。塞西尔说她根本\n"
"没见过帕兹。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/47
msgid ""
"She's at least 10 years too old.\n"
msgstr ""
"她至少老了10岁。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/49
msgid ""
"I'm guessing Paz convinced herself that it\n"
"was the tape her friend made.\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜帕兹说服了自己，那\n"
"是她朋友录的磁带。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/50
msgid ""
"But never mind that. Let's go over what\n"
"we know so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"先别管。我们梳理下\n"
"目前线索。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/51
msgid ""
"The soldier with the ID card is wearing an\n"
"orange jacket\n"
msgstr ""
"持有ID卡的士兵穿着\n"
"橙色夹克\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/52
msgid ""
"and is in a location where you'll hear\n"
"quetzals singing.\n"
msgstr ""
"位置在能听到\n"
"凤尾绿咬鹃鸣叫的地方。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/53
msgid ""
"Find that soldier. Retrieve that card.\n"
msgstr ""
"找到那个士兵。取回ID卡。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, to gain access to the lab you'll\n"
"need an ID card.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，要进入实验室\n"
"你需要一张ID卡。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/1
msgid ""
"You can get one from a guard in an\n"
"orange jacket stationed in an area where\n"
"you can hear quetzals singing.\n"
msgstr ""
"可从穿橙夹克的守卫\n"
"身上拿到，他驻守在\n"
"能听到凤尾绿咬鹃鸣叫处。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/2
msgid ""
"To get the ID card from the soldier, do a\n"
"body check.\n"
msgstr ""
"要从士兵身上拿ID卡，\n"
"就对他搜身。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/3
msgid ""
"You've got to get inside that lab before\n"
"the AI gets shipped out. Get a move on!\n"
msgstr ""
"你必须在AI被运走前\n"
"进入实验室。抓紧行动！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c2c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, that's the Chrysalis weapon Huey\n"
"was referring to.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，那就是休伊提到的\n"
"蝶蛹武器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c2c0/1
msgid ""
"You know what to do!\n"
msgstr ""
"你知道该怎么做！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/1
msgid ""
"She played me like a piano...\n"
msgstr ""
"她把我耍得团团转……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/2
msgid ""
"Forget about it. You'll get 'em back.\n"
msgstr ""
"别想了。你会夺回来的。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/3
msgid ""
"That is, as long as you've got the will to\n"
"do it.\n"
msgstr ""
"前提是你有\n"
"这个决心。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/4
msgid ""
"I'm not giving up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不放弃。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/5
msgid ""
"All right, then...\n"
msgstr ""
"那好……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/6
msgid ""
"I confirmed the location with Huey.\n"
msgstr ""
"我向休伊确认了位置。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/7
msgid ""
"The final testing base for Peace Walker is\n"
"15 miles to the north of that lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"和平行者的最终测试基地\n"
"在实验室以北15英里处。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/8
msgid ""
"It's an underground facility disguised as a\n"
"rock quarry.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是个伪装成采石场的\n"
"地下设施。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/9
msgid ""
"All you need to do is sneak in and\n"
"destroy the AI for good this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你只需潜入进去，\n"
"这次彻底摧毁AI。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/11
msgid ""
"Snake, you can destroy it, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你能摧毁它吧？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/13
msgid ""
"We all have our limits - actions beyond\n"
"our abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们都有极限——\n"
"力所不能及的事。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/14
msgid ""
"Don't worry. I won't screw it up this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心，这次我不会搞砸。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/15
msgid ""
"You're the one who killed The Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS是你杀的。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/16
msgid ""
"Destroying that AI means reliving that\n"
"memory.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁掉那台AI，等于重温那段\n"
"记忆。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/17
msgid ""
"It's just a machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是台机器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/18
msgid ""
"Snake, I'm worried.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我很担心。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/19
msgid ""
"Worried?\n"
msgstr ""
"担心？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/20
msgid ""
"For the same reason the CIA entrusted\n"
"the nuclear launch to an AI.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA把核弹发射交给AI，也是\n"
"同样的道理。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/21
msgid ""
"A man can condemn a handful of\n"
"criminals to the death penalty\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人可以判处少数\n"
"罪犯死刑\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/22
msgid ""
"if they're prepared to assume that\n"
"responsibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果他们准备好承担\n"
"这份责任。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/23
msgid ""
"But who among us could do the same to\n"
"hundreds of millions of innocent civilians?\n"
msgstr ""
"可谁能对数亿无辜平民下\n"
"同样的手？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/24
msgid ""
"Who could reduce thousands of years of\n"
"human history to ash in an instant?\n"
msgstr ""
"谁能把数千年人类历史\n"
"瞬间化为灰烬？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/25
msgid ""
"Could any flesh-and-blood human being\n"
"make that decision?\n"
msgstr ""
"血肉之躯的人，做得出\n"
"这种决定吗？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/26
msgid ""
"No way in hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"绝不可能。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/27
msgid ""
"No one man could bear the burden of\n"
"total genocide.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人扛得起种族灭绝的\n"
"重担。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/28
msgid ""
"It's what's allowed our cowardly species\n"
"to survive all this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"正因如此，我们这懦弱的\n"
"物种才活到今天。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/29
msgid ""
"But for a machine, willpower is no issue.\n"
msgstr ""
"但机器没有意志问题。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/30
msgid ""
"What are you saying, Kaz?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想说什么，卡兹？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/31
msgid ""
"You're a hero, Snake. But you're not a\n"
"machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"你是英雄，SNAKE。但你不是\n"
"机器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/32
msgid ""
"That I can't destroy that thing?\n"
msgstr ""
"我毁不掉那东西？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/33
msgid ""
"That machine's not the problem. It's that\n"
"The Boss still lives - inside of you.\n"
msgstr ""
"问题不在那台机器。是THE BOSS\n"
"还活在你心里。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/34
msgid ""
"Bullshit!\n"
msgstr ""
"胡说！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/35
msgid ""
"She's dead, Snake. It's time to come to\n"
"terms with that.\n"
msgstr ""
"她死了，SNAKE。该接受\n"
"现实了。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/36
msgid ""
"Let me put it another way.\n"
msgstr ""
"我换个说法。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/37
msgid ""
"You've left everything behind - your\n"
"country, your identity, your past and\n"
"ideals...\n"
msgstr ""
"你抛下了一切——你的\n"
"国家、身份、过去和\n"
"理想……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/38
msgid ""
"But there's still one thing you haven't let\n"
"go of.\n"
msgstr ""
"但有一样东西你还没\n"
"放下。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/40
msgid ""
"The Boss. You still haven't let her go.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS。你还是没能放下她。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/41
msgid ""
"That's why you're so afraid to find out\n"
"the truth about her.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以你才这么害怕查明\n"
"她的真相。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/42
msgid ""
"And that's what's holding you back from\n"
"your future.\n"
msgstr ""
"也正是这让你无法迈向\n"
"未来。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/43
msgid ""
"Snake, she died a decade ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，她都死了十年了。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/44
msgid ""
"How long can you live with a ghost?\n"
msgstr ""
"你带个亡魂能活多久？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/45
msgid ""
"Kaz, I thought I knew everything about\n"
"her.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaz, I thought I knew everything about\n"
"her.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/46
msgid ""
"But I still don't understand what\n"
"happened to her at the end.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我始终不明白她最后\n"
"到底发生了什么。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/47
msgid ""
"There you are no different from that\n"
"scientist woman.\n"
msgstr ""
"这点上你和那个女科学家\n"
"没什么两样。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/48
msgid ""
"When she didn't believe me, I realized\n"
"something.\n"
msgstr ""
"When she didn't believe me, I realized\n"
"something.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/49
msgid ""
"That debriefing I heard could've been part\n"
"of the cover story they made up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我听到的那份简报可能是\n"
"他们编造的掩饰。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/50
msgid ""
"Now even I'm not sure what her real\n"
"intentions were.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在连我都不确定她的真实\n"
"意图。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/51
msgid ""
"Why did she take that mission?\n"
msgstr ""
"她为何接那任务？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/52
msgid ""
"How did she feel about dying?\n"
msgstr ""
"她怎么看待死？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/53
msgid ""
"Why was I chosen?\n"
msgstr ""
"为何选我？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/54
msgid ""
"You want to know the truth?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想知道真相？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/55
msgid ""
"The truth won't change the past. You still\n"
"want to know?\n"
msgstr ""
"真相改变不了过去。你还\n"
"想知道吗？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/56
msgid ""
"...No. I took on this mission for a kid who\n"
"believes in peace.\n"
msgstr ""
"……不。我接这任务\n"
"是为一个信和平的孩子。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/57
msgid ""
"Hm. Fine, then. There's no point in\n"
"arguing. Peace Walker is on the verge of\n"
"completion.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hm. Fine, then. There's no point in\n"
"arguing. Peace Walker is on the verge of\n"
"completion.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/58
msgid ""
"C'mon, Boss. Let's get to that base!\n"
msgstr ""
"来吧，BOSS。去那座基地！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d5b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the Peace Walker platform and AI\n"
"have been shipped to the final testing\n"
"base.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake, the Peace Walker platform and AI\n"
"have been shipped to the final testing\n"
"base.\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d5b0/1
msgid ""
"Once assembled, it's only a matter of\n"
"time before they launch the nukes. Hurry!\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦组装完成，他们发射核弹\n"
"就只是时间问题。快！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d6f0/0
msgid ""
"Dammit, you've been spotted by the\n"
"guards! Take them out before they take\n"
"you out!\n"
msgstr ""
"Dammit, you've been spotted by the\n"
"guards! Take them out before they take\n"
"you out!\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d7c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's Huey's unmanned weapon -\n"
"the Cocoon! Put it out of commission!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！那是休伊的无人武器——\n"
"茧！把它废掉！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d890/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker is in a hangar at the\n"
"very bottom of the mine.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，和平行者在矿井\n"
"最底层的机库里。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d890/1
msgid ""
"Infiltrate the base and put a stop to the\n"
"project by destroying Peace Walker's AI\n"
"pod.\n"
msgstr ""
"Infiltrate the base and put a stop to the\n"
"project by destroying Peace Walker's AI\n"
"pod.\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/0
msgid ""
"...Snake, I hope you can hear me.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，希望你能听到。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/1
msgid ""
"Word is you've been captured by\n"
"Strangelove.\n"
msgstr ""
"听说你被\n"
"Strangelove抓走了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/2
msgid ""
"I'm guessing they confiscated your gear.\n"
"But I know you've still got something left.\n"
msgstr ""
"装备八成被没收了。\n"
"但你肯定还有别的东西。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/3
msgid ""
"Search your memory, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"好好想想，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/2
msgid ""
"It's good to hear your voice again.\n"
msgstr ""
"又能听到你的声音了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/3
msgid ""
"Sorry! Hey, you OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"抱歉！你没事吧？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/4
msgid ""
"Yeah.... Lungs taste like charcoal.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……肺里全是焦味。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/5
msgid ""
"No smoking for you for a while, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"你得戒烟一阵子了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/6
msgid ""
"Nah, I'll be fine. I'd better get moving.\n"
msgstr ""
"没事，我撑得住。该走了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/7
msgid ""
"Nice work.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/8
msgid ""
"What's the situation with you? Everyone\n"
"OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"你那边如何？大家\n"
"都好吗？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/9
msgid ""
"Yeah... But there's a slight problem. I can't\n"
"get a hold of Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……但有个小问题。联系不上\n"
"帕兹。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/10
msgid ""
"Paz? I thought the \"professor\" was\n"
"looking after her?\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹？不是那位\"教授\"在\n"
"照顾她吗？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/11
msgid ""
"So did I. Here's the deal.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也这么想。情况是这样。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/12
msgid ""
"I started thinking, and I sent someone\n"
"over to the \"school\" the \"professor\"\n"
"mentioned.\n"
msgstr ""
"我开始琢磨，就派人去了\n"
"\"教授\"提到的\n"
"那所\"学校\"。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/13
msgid ""
"...And the \"school\" doesn't exist?\n"
msgstr ""
"……结果\"学校\"不存在？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/14
msgid ""
"No, it exists, but Paz has been a no-show.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，存在，但帕兹没露面。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/15
msgid ""
"The person at the school said neither the\n"
"\"professor\"\n"
msgstr ""
"The person at the school said neither the\n"
"\"professor\"\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/16
msgid ""
"nor Paz had been seen there in quite\n"
"some time.\n"
msgstr ""
"和Paz都很久\n"
"没在那出现了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/17
msgid ""
"...Coldman knew about us. We've been\n"
"marked by the CIA.\n"
msgstr ""
"……科尔德曼知道我们。我们被\n"
"CIA盯上了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/18
msgid ""
"The KGB and Paz brought us into all this.\n"
"Coldman must know about them, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"是克格勃和帕兹把我们卷进来的。\n"
"科尔德曼肯定也知道他们。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/19
msgid ""
"You think... Coldman's got them...?\n"
msgstr ""
"你是说……科尔德曼抓了他们……？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/20
msgid ""
"No. Remember, Gálvez isn't some\n"
"pencil-pusher.\n"
msgstr ""
"不。加尔维斯可不是\n"
"坐办公室的。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/21
msgid ""
"Yeah... The KGB'll have eyes on Coldman\n"
"night and day, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"对……克格勃也会日夜盯着\n"
"科尔德曼。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/22
msgid ""
"Which could mean they knew what the\n"
"CIA would try to do and are just staying\n"
"out of sight...\n"
msgstr ""
"也就是说，他们可能知道CIA\n"
"想干什么，只是躲起来\n"
"不露面……\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/23
msgid ""
"Let's hope so. See what you can get out\n"
"of the KGB, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"希望如此。去克格勃那里\n"
"套点东西，Kaz。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/24
msgid ""
"All right. Back to work.\n"
msgstr ""
"好，继续干活。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/25
msgid ""
"I'd better get moving.\n"
msgstr ""
"我得走了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/26
msgid ""
"Snake, we haven't detected any signs\n"
"that Peace Walker's been activated,\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我们还没发现任何迹象\n"
"表明Peace Walker已启动，\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/27
msgid ""
"at least from above ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"至少地面上没有。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/28
msgid ""
"It's still in the hangar you were in earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"它还在你之前去过的机库里。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/29
msgid ""
"This time, it's really our last chance.\n"
"Destroy that AI!\n"
msgstr ""
"这次真是最后机会。\n"
"摧毁那个AI！\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/30
msgid ""
"On my way.\n"
msgstr ""
"就去。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f0e0/0
msgid ""
"Peace Walker's active, and its\n"
"self-defense system is targeting you,\n"
"Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peace Walker启动了，它的\n"
"自卫系统正瞄准你，\n"
"Snake。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f0e0/1
msgid ""
"You'd better find a way to stop it, quick!\n"
msgstr ""
"你最好快点想办法阻止它！\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/1
msgid ""
"Kaz, Peace Walker's gone... They've got\n"
"Paz, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaz，Peace Walker不见了……他们还\n"
"抓走了Paz。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/3
msgid ""
"Why, Kaz? What would Coldman want with\n"
"Paz?\n"
msgstr ""
"为什么，Kaz？Coldman要\n"
"Paz干嘛？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/4
msgid ""
"Paz was with the \"professor\", i.e., the\n"
"KGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paz和那个“教授”在一起，也就是\n"
"克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/5
msgid ""
"Once Coldman discovered that, he figured\n"
"out what was really going on between\n"
"Paz and Gálvez.\n"
msgstr ""
"Coldman一发现这点，就弄清了\n"
"Paz和Gálvez之间\n"
"到底是怎么回事。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/6
msgid ""
"He's trying to figure out how the KGB\n"
"plan to stop Peace Walker,\n"
msgstr ""
"他正试图弄清克格勃\n"
"打算如何阻止Peace Walker，\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/7
msgid ""
"and he thinks he can get the info from\n"
"Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"他认为能从\n"
"Paz那里得到情报。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/8
msgid ""
"That's crazy! Paz won't know anything.\n"
msgstr ""
"疯了！帕兹什么都不知道。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/9
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, he probably doesn't buy that.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，可他大概不信。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/10
msgid ""
"...You think Gálvez has already been\n"
"killed? By grabbing Paz, Coldman's saying...\n"
msgstr ""
"……你觉得Gálvez已经被\n"
"杀了吗？抓走Paz，Coldman是在说……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/11
msgid ""
"\"Stay out of this, or lose your client.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“别插手，不然丢客户。”\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/12
msgid ""
"Dammit! I can't believe we didn't realize\n"
"what was going on before we lost\n"
"contact with Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"该死！真不敢相信和Paz\n"
"失去联系前，竟没意识到\n"
"发生了什么。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/13
msgid ""
"Don't have time for that, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"没空说这个，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/15
msgid ""
"Paz needs our help.\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹要帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/16
msgid ""
"Right. This isn't about money anymore.\n"
"You better move. We know where they're\n"
"headed.\n"
msgstr ""
"对。这不再是钱的事。\n"
"你最好行动。我们知道\n"
"他们去哪了。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/18
msgid ""
"You can thank Amanda.\n"
msgstr ""
"得谢阿曼达。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/19
msgid ""
"Snake, that river you chased the basilisco\n"
"across is the Rio San Juan.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你追蛇怪渡过的河\n"
"是圣胡安河。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/20
msgid ""
"The other side is our country.\n"
msgstr ""
"对岸是我们国家。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/21
msgid ""
"I had some Nicaraguan compas track it\n"
"there.\n"
msgstr ""
"I had some Nicaraguan compas track it\n"
"there.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/22
msgid ""
"They're focos from the GPP (Guerra\n"
"Popular Prolongada) faction,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们是GPP（持久人民战争）\n"
"派的据点，\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/23
msgid ""
"so we don't work together so much...\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我们不太合作……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/24
msgid ""
"Where'd it go?\n"
msgstr ""
"哪去了？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/25
msgid ""
"West, along the border, towards Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"
msgstr ""
"West, along the border, towards Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/26
msgid ""
"There's a U.S. military supply base on the\n"
"southeastern shore of the lake.\n"
msgstr ""
"There's a U.S. military supply base on the\n"
"southeastern shore of the lake.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/27
msgid ""
"Ever since that earthquake two years\n"
"ago, America's had the entire region to\n"
"itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ever since that earthquake two years\n"
"ago, America's had the entire region to\n"
"itself.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/28
msgid ""
"That is where the basilisco is. I'm sure of\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"That is where the basilisco is. I'm sure of\n"
"it.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/29
msgid ""
"Lago Cocibolca... How do I get across the\n"
"border?\n"
msgstr ""
"Lago Cocibolca……我怎么过\n"
"边境？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/30
msgid ""
"There's a route that we use to cross.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们有一条过境的路线。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/31
msgid ""
"It's just a little boat, but I can introduce\n"
"you to the captain.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是小船，但我能介绍\n"
"船长给你。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/32
msgid ""
"I appreciate it.\n"
msgstr ""
"多谢。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/33
msgid ""
"We will never leave Nicaragua at the\n"
"mercy of someone like William Walker\n"
"again.\n"
msgstr ""
"绝不让尼加拉瓜再落入\n"
"William Walker之流\n"
"手中。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/34
msgid ""
"Snake, Coldman's going to launch the\n"
"nuke from that base. He's targeting MSF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，Coldman要从那基地\n"
"发射核弹。目标MSF。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/35
msgid ""
"Based on what Huey's told us, it'll take\n"
"two more days to prep for launch.\n"
msgstr ""
"据Huey说，还需\n"
"两天准备发射。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/36
msgid ""
"...But it looks like there's another reason\n"
"they picked that date.\n"
msgstr ""
"……但选那日子似乎\n"
"另有原因。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/38
msgid ""
"Tomorrow is day one of a U.S.-Soviet\n"
"summit in Vladivostok.\n"
msgstr ""
"明天是美苏\n"
"符拉迪沃斯托克峰会首日。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/39
msgid ""
"The launch is probably connected\n"
"somehow.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射可能与此\n"
"有关。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/40
msgid ""
"That's right... They're holding the SALT-II\n"
"(Strategic Arms Limitation Treaty) talks.\n"
msgstr ""
"对……他们在开SALT-II\n"
"（限制战略武器条约）会谈。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/41
msgid ""
"You think Coldman's trying to disrupt the\n"
"negotiations?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得Coldman想破坏\n"
"谈判？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/42
msgid ""
"Either that, or use it as a bargaining chip...\n"
msgstr ""
"要么如此，要么拿它当筹码……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/43
msgid ""
"He's still got Paz, too. At any rate, we're\n"
"running out of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"他还抓了Paz。总之，我们\n"
"没时间了。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/44
msgid ""
"I'll figure something out.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会想办法的。\n"
